      'Storage is GB-months, not only new monthly bytes. Multiply eligible monthly artifacts by the agreed retention period; add candidates/noncurrent versions, trusted fixtures, audit/logs and backups separately. Specify average object/item sizes, transaction units, queue batching and download/egress volume before pricing.',
